\"https:\/\/www.theimmigrationdepot.ca\/employers\/our-expertise\/\">Our Expertise<\/a><\/li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-988\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-988\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theimmigrationdepot.ca\/employers\/resources-guides-forms\/\">Resources, Guides &amp; Forms<\/a><\/li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1002\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1002\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theimmigrationdepot.ca\/employers\/faqs\/\">FAQs<\/a><\/li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-901\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-901\"><a href=\"\/book-consult\/\">Book a Phone Consultation<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"text-widget-6\" class=\" widget text-widget\"><div class=\"download-widget \"><ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/4Hdzr95LFig\"><i class=\"\"><\/i>Watch The Immigration Depot&#039;s Video<\/a><li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><div id=\"text-widget-7\" class=\" widget text-widget\"><div class=\"contact-widget \"  ><div><h3>Need Help?<\/h3><p>Contact us today for a phone consultation.\r\nWe can assess your situation during this time and suggest next steps.<\/p><a class=\"theme-btn\" href=\"\/book-consult\/\">Book a Consultation Now<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7dbb273\" data-id=\"7dbb273\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5416ee7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5416ee7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Resources, Guides &amp; Forms<\/h1>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2cbbc73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2cbbc73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>At The Immigration Depot we work hard to be a one-stop-shop for all your immigration requirements. Please find resources below for Labour Market Impact Assessments, Temporary Resident Work Permit Process and application Information. If you can find the information you are looking for, please access our FAQs (Frequently Asked Questions) or don\u2019t hesitate to contact us for a <a href=\"\/book-consult\/\">Phone Consultation<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-672dc1f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"672dc1f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"828\" height=\"498\" src=\"https:\/\/www.theimmigrationdepot.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/07\/resources_pic.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"The Immigration Depot: Resources\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theimmigrationdepot.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/07\/resources_pic.jpg 828w, https:\/\/www.theimmigrationdepot.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/07\/resources_pic-300x180.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theimmigrationdepot.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/07\/resources_pic-768x462.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 828px) 100vw, 828px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0486476 elementor-tabs-view-horizontal elementor-widget elementor-widget-tabs\" data-id=\"0486476\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"tabs.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-tabs\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-tabs-wrapper\" role=\"tablist\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-4741\" class=\"elementor-tab-title elementor-tab-desktop-title\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-4741\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><a href=\"\">Labour Market Impact Assessment<\/a><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-4742\" class=\"elementor-tab-title elementor-tab-desktop-title\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-4742\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><a href=\"\">Temporary Resident Work Permits<\/a><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-tabs-content-wrapper\" role=\"tablist\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-tab-title elementor-tab-mobile-title\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-4741\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Labour Market Impact Assessment<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-4741\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-4741\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"false\"><p>The process involves fulfilling advertising and other requirements; these requirements vary from province to province. We will provide you with all the information relevant to your province. Entirely up to your choosing, we can guide you through the process or we can advertise for you through the Job Bank or other alternate recruitment channels.<\/p><p>All attempts to hire foreign workers are subject to a Labour Market Impact Assessment (LMIA). We can assist you through this process. We advertise the jobs in question and assist in providing proof that you are unable to find qualified Canadian workers. We will assist you in submitting an HRSDC Foreign Worker Application for a Labour Market Impact Assessment (LMIA) to the Service Canada Center responsible for your area.<\/p><p>Our immigration staff can do this on your company\u2019s behalf in order to ensure minimal delays. After the positive LMIA has been issued, we will send a copy of the confirmation letter to recruitment partners abroad. This will be submitted along with the prospective foreign worker&#8217;s documentation to the Canadian Consulate in order to obtain their visas.<\/p><p>The foreign worker&#8217;s that you select will submit their application for the Canadian work visa.\u00a0 We also provide the selected candidates with a comprehensive consultation on how to obtain their permanent residence in Canada (if applicable).<\/p><p>The prospect of obtaining permanent residence enforces their commitment and loyalty to your company. Foreign workers will put in more effort to improve their language skills and acquire any complementary skills needed to meet immigration requirements.<\/p><ol><li>Identify your need and appropriate Candidate<\/li><li>Prepare advertisements and post ads as per requirements of ESDC.<\/li><li>Gather documents and prepare application<\/li><li>Submit application with applicable fees following 30-day expiry of advertisements.<\/li><li>Upon approval, have your identified candidate apply for work permit.<\/li><\/ol><p>The Immigration Depot will guide you through the entire process to ensure there is nothing missed in the complex process that could impact a positive decision on the application.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-tab-title elementor-tab-mobile-title\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-4742\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Temporary Resident Work Permits<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-4742\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-4742\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"hidden\"><p>You must ensure anyone in your employ is legally eligible to work in Canada. There are 2 types of work permits, open work permit or employer-specific work permits. The employer must be aware of the eligibility requirements for anyone in their employ.<\/p><p>There are expiry dates to work permits and the TFW must ensure they maintain their respective status while in your employ.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1d3cf4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1d3cf4\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-64c54123\" data-id=\"64c54123\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-434a95b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"434a95b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"testimonial-slider-wrp\">\r\n     \t<div class=\" rtsw-video rtsw-testimonial-1 rtsw-testimonial rtsw-cleararea template-7\" id=\"rtsw-vp-2\">\r\n     \t<div id=\"rtsw-quote-937\" class=\"rtsw-testimonial-bo